  "title": "procmon: fix coverity resource leak",
  "description": "Fixing the resource leak by simply freeing up `str_buf` before return.\n\nBasically, just add (duplicate) 2 lines from the end of the function before `return;`.\n\n```\n        if (!wtap_read_bytes_or_eof(wth->fh, &addr, sizeof(addr), err, err_info))\n        {\n            ws_debug(\"wtap_read_bytes_or_eof() failed, err = %d.\", *err);\n            g_regex_unref(numeric_re);\n            g_free(str_buf);\n            return;\n        }\n```\n\nCoverity CID 1678241 (Resource leak)",
